RELATIONSHIP TO MATERIAL WEB COMPONENTS (NOT A FORK)
=====================================================================

Matecha is an independent, from-scratch implementation that is API-compatible
with Material Web Components (@material/web), version 2.5.0:

    Project:    Material Web Components
    Source:     https://github.com/material-components/material-web
    Package:    @material/web@2.5.0
    Copyright:  Copyright 2023 Google LLC
    License:    Apache License, Version 2.0

  * Matecha is NOT a fork. It contains no source code from @material/web and
    has no runtime dependency on Lit, tslib or any @material/* package.
  * Only the public interface is shared for drop-in compatibility: element
    (tag) names, attribute and property names, method names, event names,
    slot and part names, and --md-sys-* / --md-<component>-* design-token
    names. These follow the design of Material Web Components 2.5.0.
  * Rendering, styling, motion and behaviour are implemented independently,
    following the Material 3 Expressive design from the MateUI reference.
  * Additional components not provided by @material/web are listed in
    SPECIFICATION.md, section 3.2.

